  "选的文件夹现在写不进去（磁盘被拔出或没有权限），录像暂时存到默认位置": "The chosen folder can't be written to now (drive removed or no permission); recordings go to the default place meanwhile",
  "录像 {0} · 缩略图 {1} · 每小时约写入 {2}，全天约 {3}": "Recordings {0} · thumbnails {1} · writes about {2} an hour, {3} a day",
  "。长期这样录会明显消耗固态硬盘的写入寿命，可以降低帧率或画质": ". Over months this wears an SSD noticeably; a lower frame rate or quality writes less",
  "这次导出压缩得多细；不会比录像本身更清楚": "How finely this export is compressed; never clearer than the recording",
