  "{0} 小时": "{0} h",
  "5 分钟": "5 min",
  "10 分钟": "10 min",
  "全部": "All",
  "时间线缩放 · Ctrl+滚轮": "Timeline zoom · Ctrl+wheel",
  // the first run's sheet
  "开始之前，先说清楚它做什么": "Before you start, here is what it does",
  "ScreenReplay 会在后台一直录着你的屏幕，直到你暂停或退出。": "ScreenReplay records your screen in the background all the time, until you pause it or quit.",
  "录什么": "What it records",
  "主屏幕的画面和系统声音。麦克风默认不录。还会记下每个时刻在前台的应用和各窗口的位置、标题，用来画时间线和按窗口导出。也会记下鼠标、键盘和手柄用得多频繁（只记次数，不记按了哪个键、点在哪里），在时间线上标出忙碌的时段。开始录制时，Windows 可能会问一次是否允许它截屏时不显示黄色边框，允许即可。": "The main display's picture and the computer's sound; the microphone is off by default. It also notes the app in front at each moment and each window's place and title, to draw the timeline and to save one window on its own. And how often the mouse, keyboard and game controller are used (counts only, never which keys, buttons or where), to mark the busy stretches on the timeline. When it starts, Windows may ask once whether it may capture without a yellow border: allow it.",
  "存在哪、留多久": "Where it is kept, and for how long",
  "只存在这台电脑上，不上传。只保留最近一段时间，更早的自动删除。": "Only on this PC, never uploaded. Only the most recent stretch is kept; anything older is deleted automatically.",
  "你随时可以": "You can always",
  "从托盘图标暂停或退出；在「设置 › 存储」里删除全部录像；在设置里关掉声音或整个后台录制。": "Pause or quit from the tray icon; delete every recording in Settings › Storage; turn off the sound, or background recording altogether, in Settings.",
  "它不做的": "What it does not do",
  "这个版本不收集任何使用统计，也不发送崩溃报告。": "This version collects no usage statistics and sends no crash reports.",
  "保留最近": "Keep the last",
  "开机时自动启动并开始录制": "Start with Windows and begin recording",
  "暂不录制": "Not now",
  "开始录制": "Start recording",
  "知道了": "Got it",
  "录制说明": "About recording",
